{"version":1,"key":"card:222","content":{"id":222,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0e82829c-ed4f-4625-99f6-dc4db2082ebb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"迭代器是一种遍历集合的一种机制，迭代器具有一个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"next()"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法，调用时返回一个对象，包含两个字段："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"a3ea93d7-9d0f-408f-98ce-0b3153623e40","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"5a4a95a6-f8dd-4045-8fa1-e8765a7022c5","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9ac999b4-6cea-4a0a-9327-89334532493a","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"done"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：为布尔值，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"false"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示集合中还有元素可遍历，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"true"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示集合中没有元素可遍历"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"9511162a-73ab-4e06-a40c-7aa581045a90","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9abc316a-cac2-4161-9b2e-fafc0b196873","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"value"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：如果 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"done"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"false"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"value"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的值为集合中的一个元素值，如果 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"done"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"true"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"value"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的值为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"undefined"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a04c80f7-e9b4-4eab-bcdc-baa93654da27","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对于数组，Set、Map 集合，都包含有内置的迭代器"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"e65d6056-5b2b-4f01-b13d-e0f215a63551","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"e08e66d4-a225-49a0-bfa5-ce86d39b0d16","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const arr = [1, 2, 3];\n// 数组的 values 方法返回一个迭代器\nconst iterator = arr.values();\nlet res = iterator.next();\nwhile (!res.done) {\n  console.log(res.value); // 1\n  \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t// 2\n  \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t// 3\n  res = iterator.next();\n}","collabId":"e19e12ae-9ca1-45cc-a995-d084fe3ed5d4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"38d1b649-efa6-4333-8d36-f2cfa5260aaa","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对于迭代器，可以通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"for ... of"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 语法糖进行迭代"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"9b7b2d3f-ecb1-4bd7-8479-e6d09461edac","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"b697cc9f-c92d-45ff-9baf-0ba683704fe3","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"// 以下写法同上\nconst arr = [1, 2, 3];\nfor (let value of arr.values()) {\n  console.log(value); // 1\n  \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t// 2\n  \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t// 3\n}","collabId":"a56bc0c0-1f36-4f70-9c83-8c82bd994c2f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}],"tags":["JavaScript"],"createTime":1690723110720,"updateTime":1743303640410,"linkedCards":[{"id":223,"target":{"key":"card:223","type":"card","id":223},"summary":"生成器是用来生成一个数据集合的，它是一个函数，当调用一个生成器时，不会立即执行生成器函数中的内容，而是会返回一个迭代器，每次调用迭代器的 next 方法，就会执行生成器函数，直至遇到 yield 表达式，会将 yield 后表达式的值返回，...","tags":["JavaScript"]},{"id":224,"target":{"key":"card:224","type":"card","id":224},"summary":"只有对于可迭代的对象才可以使用 for ... of 语法进行迭代，那什么对象是可迭代的呢，如果一个对象具有 Symbol.iterator 属性，并且是一个函数，该函数返回的是一个迭代器，那么它就是可迭代的，每次我们使用 for ... ...","tags":["JavaScript"]},{"id":225,"target":{"key":"card:225","type":"card","id":225},"summary":"对于数组、 Set 和 Map 集合，它们都有三个内置的迭代器，分别是： values keys entries values 是所有值的集合， keys 是所有键的集合，数组和 Set 没有键，对于数组来说，键就是下标，对于 Set 来说...","tags":["JavaScript"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743303640410}}